ine":157,"source_layer":"received_biography"},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018","book_id":"b-jinshu-037","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p009","text":"及東海王越奉迎大駕，顒啟帝復穎還鄴，以志為魏郡太守，加左將軍，隨穎北鎮。行達洛陽，而平昌公模遣前鋒督護馮嵩距穎。穎還長安，未至而聞顒斬張方，求和於越。穎住華陰，志進長安，詣闕陳謝，即還就穎于武關。奔南陽，復為劉陶所驅，回詣河北。及穎薨，官屬奔散，唯志親自殯送，時人嘉之。越命志為軍諮祭酒，遷衛尉，永嘉末，轉尚書。洛陽沒，志將妻子北投并州刺史劉琨。至陽邑，為劉粲所虜，與次子謐、詵等俱遇害於平陽。長子諶。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","source_position":{"rendered_tool_line":202,"capture_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/received-rendered-capture.json","capture_kind":"existing_rendered_text_not_raw","projection":"remove leading ideographic spaces and tool-link wrappers only"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p009:m0001","start":1,"end":5,"surface":"東海王越","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADBA","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依本篇角色及已列原段，首選沿用現役身份；限制另列。身份審讀：yue。","source_identity_role":"yue","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#yue"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p009:m0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"顒","kind":"person","person_id":"ed0_313_bea","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依本篇角色及已列原段，首選沿用現役身份；限制另列。身份審讀：yong。","source_identity_role":"yong","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#yong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p009:m0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAA","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依本篇角色及已列原段，首選沿用現役身份；限制另列。身份審讀：huidi。","source_identity_role":"huidi","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#huidi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p009:m0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAC","status":"contextual_provisiona