rce_identity_role":"chen","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#chen"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu044-lu-rendered-oldcapture"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-wei-ying-children:p002","text":"穎既廢，河北思之。鄴中故將公師籓、汲桑等起兵以迎穎，眾情翕然。顒復拜穎鎮軍大將軍、都督河北諸軍事，給兵千人，鎮鄴。穎至洛，而東海王越率眾迎大駕，所在鋒起。穎以北方盛強，懼不可進，自洛陽奔關中。值大駕還洛，穎自華陰趨武關，出新野。帝詔鎮南將軍劉弘、南中郎將劉陶收捕穎，於是棄母妻，單車與二子廬江王普、中都王廓渡河赴朝歌，收合故將士數百人，欲就公師籓。頓丘太守馮嵩執穎及普、廓送鄴，范陽王虓幽之，而無他意。屬虓暴薨，虓長史劉輿見穎為鄴都所服，慮為後患，秘不發喪，偽令人為臺使，稱詔夜賜穎死。穎謂守者田徽曰：「范陽王亡乎？」徽曰：「不知。」穎曰：「卿年幾？」徽曰：「五十。」穎曰：「知天命不？」徽曰：「不知。」穎曰：「我死之後，天下安乎不安乎？我自放逐，於今三年，身體手足不見洗沐，取數斗湯來！」其二子號泣，穎敕人將去。乃散發東首臥，命徽縊之，時年二十八。二子亦死。鄴中哀之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","source_position":{"raw_start":16697,"raw_end":17084,"raw_line":163,"wikitext_sha256":"a83fe708c8dffc5965863d337a19fd4e7222ae41e29aa99e1c2a11ed8030d1d3"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-wei-ying-children:p002:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAC","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"ying"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-wei-ying-children:p002:m0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"公師籓","kind":"person","person_id":"xmp_cnb_pvt","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"gongshifan"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-wei-ying-children:p002:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"汲桑","kind":"person","person_id":"axz_rnu_ukl","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"jisang"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-wei-ying-children:p002:m0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAC","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"ying"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-wei-ying-children:p002:m0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"顒","kind":"person","person_id":"ed0_313_bea","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"yong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-wei-ying-children:p002:m0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_g